*** Settings ***
Library    DateTime

*** Test Cases ***
Schedule Reactor Cooldown
    ${start_time}=    Get Current Date    result_format=%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S
    Log    Cooldown started: ${start_time}
    ${completion_time}=    Add Time To Date    ${start_time}    2 hours
    Log    Cooldown completes: ${completion_time}
    Should Not Be Equal    ${start_time}    ${completion_time}

Schedule Next Diagnostic
    ${now}=    Get Current Date    result_format=%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S
    ${next_check}=    Add Time To Date    ${now}    30 minutes
    Log    Next diagnostic: ${next_check}
    ${next_day}=    Add Time To Date    ${now}    1 day
    Log    Tomorrow same time: ${next_day}
    Should Contain    ${next_day}    -
